We unveiled the @challanpay.in brand film with @pratikgandhiofficial on stage followed by a few memorable moments, conversations and plenty of energy around the launch.

From the first screening to Pratik joining us on stage and the reactions that followed, Day 4 was all about bringing the ChallanPay story to life in front of a live audience.

A glimpse from a milestone we’ll remember for a long time.

